abstract: >-
  Onset-stratified evaluation of gene-level evolutionary scores. Measures how
  the discriminative power of deep-time conservation and recent human
  population constraint changes with disease age of onset, and what those
  scores add over a non-evolutionary baseline.
keywords:
  - human genetics
  - purifying selection
  - gene constraint
  - sequence conservation
  - target prioritisation
